          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 5,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "Every person, who is liable to pay advance tax under section 404 (whether or not he has been previously assessed by way of regular assessment) shall, on his own accord, pay advance tax on the specified sum, calculated in the manner laid down in section 405, at the appropriate percentage, on or before the due date of each instalment, as specified in section 408.",
